<para>Write the following terms and definitions in your math notebook:</para>
<para>A <term data-schema-version="1.0" data-store="glossary-tooltip">geometric sequence</term> is a sequence in which each term is found by multiplying the previous term by the same constant.
</para>
<para>The number that is multiplied by each term is called the <term data-schema-version="1.0" data-store="glossary-tooltip">common ratio</term>.</para><br/>
